# 🎯 Cursor Rules - Rewind the Map Project

## 📋 **CORE RULE: NO WORK WITHOUT TICKETS**

**CRITICAL:** All development work MUST be tracked through the task management system.

## 🚫 **PROHIBITED ACTIONS WITHOUT TICKETS**

Never do these without first creating/updating a task:
- Write new code
- Fix bugs  
- Add features
- Refactor code
- Update dependencies
- Change configurations
- Create new files
- Modify existing files
- Update documentation
- Change project structure

## ✅ **MANDATORY WORKFLOW**

### Before Starting Any Work:
1. Create requirements: `@cursor Create requirements for: [feature description]`
2. Create use cases: `@cursor Create use cases for: [feature description]`
3. Create task: `@cursor Create a new task for: [description]`
4. Link requirements: `@cursor Link task TASK-XXX to requirements: REQ-XXX-001,REQ-XXX-002`
5. Link use cases: `@cursor Link task TASK-XXX to use cases: UC-XXX-001,DEV-UC-XXX-001`
6. Create branch: `@cursor Create branch for task TASK-XXX`
7. Move to in-progress: `@cursor Move task TASK-XXX to in-progress`

### During Development:
1. Update progress: `@cursor Update task TASK-XXX with: actualHours=4, description="Progress update"`
2. Move to review when ready: `@cursor Move task TASK-XXX to review`

### After Completion:
1. Create Pull Request: `@cursor Create PR for task TASK-XXX`
2. Move to review: `@cursor Move task TASK-XXX to review`
3. After PR approval: `@cursor Merge PR for task TASK-XXX`
4. Move to done: `@cursor Move task TASK-XXX to done`
5. Update final details: `@cursor Update task TASK-XXX with: actualHours=8, description="Completed"`

## 🎯 **REQUIRED CURSOR COMMANDS**

### Requirements & Use Cases:
```
@cursor Create requirements for: implementing user authentication system
@cursor Create use cases for: implementing user authentication system
@cursor Create developer use cases for: implementing user authentication system
```

### Task Creation:
```
@cursor Create a new task for: implementing user authentication system
@cursor Create a new task for: fixing photo upload bug in mobile app
@cursor Create a new task for: adding dark mode toggle to settings
```

### Task Linking:
```
@cursor Link task TASK-026 to requirements: REQ-026-001,REQ-026-002
@cursor Link task TASK-026 to use cases: UC-026-001,DEV-UC-026-001
@cursor Link task TASK-026 to acceptance criteria: AC-026-001,AC-026-002
```

### Task Updates:
```
@cursor Update task TASK-026 with: assignee=frontend-dev, hours=16
@cursor Update task TASK-039 with: actualHours=8, description="Time slider animation completed"
```

### Task Movement:
```
@cursor Move task TASK-026 to in-progress
@cursor Move task TASK-039 to review
@cursor Move task TASK-033 to done
```

### Git Branching:
```
@cursor Create branch for task TASK-026: feature/TASK-026-photo-upload-interface
@cursor Switch to branch: feature/TASK-026-photo-upload-interface
@cursor Create PR for task TASK-026
@cursor Merge PR for task TASK-026
@cursor Delete branch: feature/TASK-026-photo-upload-interface
```

### Progress Tracking:
```
@cursor Generate progress report for Phase 1
@cursor List all tasks in in-progress
@cursor Show details for task TASK-026
```

## 🔧 **GIT INTEGRATION RULES**

### Commit Message Format:
- MUST include task ID: `feat(TASK-026): implement photo upload interface`
- MUST use conventional commits: `type(TASK-XXX): description`

### Branch Naming:
- MUST include task ID: `feature/TASK-026-photo-upload`
- MUST be descriptive: `fix/TASK-039-time-slider-bug`

### Pull Request Titles:
- MUST reference task ID: `TASK-026: Photo Upload Interface`
- MUST be descriptive and clear

## 🎯 **QUICK REFERENCE**

### Start New Work:
```
@cursor Create a new task for: [work description]
@cursor Move task TASK-XXX to in-progress
@cursor Update task TASK-XXX with: assignee=my-name
```

### Update Progress:
```
@cursor Update task TASK-XXX with: actualHours=4, description="Progress update"
```

### Complete Work:
```
@cursor Move task TASK-XXX to review
@cursor Update task TASK-XXX with: actualHours=8, description="Completed"
@cursor Move task TASK-XXX to done
```

### Check Status:
```
@cursor Generate progress report
@cursor List all tasks in in-progress
```

## 🚨 **ENFORCEMENT RULES**

### **Git Hooks Enforce:**
- ❌ **No commits without task IDs** - All commits must include TASK-XXX
- ❌ **No direct commits to main** - All work must be in feature branches
- ❌ **No invalid branch names** - Must follow type/TASK-XXX-description format
- ❌ **No commits without proper format** - Must use conventional commits

### **Task Management Enforces:**
- ❌ **No work without requirements** - Every task must have linked requirements
- ❌ **No work without use cases** - Every task must have user and developer use cases
- ❌ **No work without acceptance criteria** - Every task must have clear completion criteria
- ❌ **No work without proper status** - Tasks must be in correct workflow status

### **Documentation Enforces:**
- ❌ **No features without documentation** - All features must be documented
- ❌ **No code without comments** - All code must be properly commented
- ❌ **No APIs without documentation** - All APIs must be documented
- ❌ **No changes without README updates** - Documentation must be kept current

## 🎯 **COMPLETE WORKFLOW EXAMPLE**

```bash
# 1. Create requirements and use cases
@cursor Create requirements for: implementing photo upload interface
@cursor Create use cases for: implementing photo upload interface
@cursor Create developer use cases for: implementing photo upload interface

# 2. Create task with linking
@cursor Create a new task for: implementing photo upload interface
@cursor Link task TASK-026 to requirements: REQ-026-001,REQ-026-002
@cursor Link task TASK-026 to use cases: UC-026-001,DEV-UC-026-001

# 3. Create branch and start work
@cursor Create branch for task TASK-026: feature/TASK-026-photo-upload-interface
@cursor Move task TASK-026 to in-progress

# 4. Work and commit (Git hooks will validate)
git add .
git commit -m "feat(TASK-026): implement drag-and-drop photo upload"

# 5. Complete and review
@cursor Move task TASK-026 to review
@cursor Create PR for task TASK-026

# 6. After approval
@cursor Merge PR for task TASK-026
@cursor Move task TASK-026 to done
@cursor Delete branch: feature/TASK-026-photo-upload-interface
```

**REMEMBER: NO WORK WITHOUT TICKETS! EVERY LINE OF CODE MUST BE TRACKED!** 🎯
